 "messages": [
  {
   "id": "EcO-SldhtH0J",
   "from": "Tareef Kawaf",
   "author": "edbcc711cdbb3da8",
   "date": "2015-05-13T20:35:48Z",
   "subject": "Updates to shinyapps.io (May 13, 2015)",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><span><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\">We are happy to announce the latest set of changes to the <a href=\"http://www.rstudio.com/products/shinyapps\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.rstudio.com/products/shinyapps&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792363396853000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1zYkRzzHp8Gn0eJuOAi5oj\">shinyapps.io</a> platform.  This release addresses some of the top requests we have heard. Please try them out and let us know what you think:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\"> </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\">-</span><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\">       </span><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-weight:bold;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\">Increase application upload size</span><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\"> – you can now include up to 1GB of data with your application bundles to use in your analyses.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\">-</span><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\">       </span><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-weight:bold;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\">Improved locale detection support </span><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\">– the updated shinyapps package can now detect and map your locale appropriately if your locale varies from the locale of <a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792363396853000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0WJ7C-kEEl4n0mLJP8cR1m\">shinyapps.io</a>  (requires shinyapps package update)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\">-</span><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\">       </span><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-weight:bold;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\">Installing larger R packages </span><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\">– historically <a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792363396853000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0WJ7C-kEEl4n0mLJP8cR1m\">shinyapps.io</a> couldn’t support installation of packages that exceeded 100MB; we have now increased the limit to 1GB. (This is primarily relevant to users of BioConductor packages)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\">-</span><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\">       </span><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-weight:bold;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\">Account Rename </span><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\">- did you pick a name for your account and wish you had selected a different one? You can now make that change in your account settings. (Note: old URLs will no longer work) </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\">-</span><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\">       </span><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-weight:bold;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\">Account Transfer</span><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\"> – If you created an account on behalf of your organization and now would like someone else to be the owner of the account, you can now transfer ownership of your account to them. (Note: You can’t get the account back unless the new owner transfers it to you)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\">-</span><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\">       </span><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-weight:bold;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\">Support for newer versions of R</span><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\"> – you can now use R 3.1.3 and 3.2.0.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\"> </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\">As always, we are looking for your feedback.  Please drop us a line and let us know how else we can improve <a href=\"http://www.rstudio.com/products/shinyapps\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.rstudio.com/products/shinyapps&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792363396853000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1zYkRzzHp8Gn0eJuOAi5oj\">shinyapps.io</a>.</span></p><div><span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:transparent\"><br></span></div></span></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
